      "items": [
        " Ministry: Ministry of Health and Family Welfare",
        " Aim:",
        " Strengthen public health infrastructure.",
        " Achieve Universal Health Coverage (UHC).",
        " Beneficiaries: BPL families, unorganized sector laborers.",
        " Coverage: Health insurance of Rs. 5 lakh for over 55 crore people (12 crore families).",
        " Key Components:",
        " Health and Wellness Centres: 1.5 lakh centres to provide primary healthcare.",
        " PM Jan Arogya Yojna (PMJAY):",
        " Rs. 5 lakh insurance per family.",
        " Covers hospitalization, surgeries, diagnostics, etc.",
        " Over 10 crore families enrolled.",
